<!-- ABN_Dev_Spike.xml (ABN_Dev spike build 0.0.0.1, TESTING ONLY; SPIKES.md S3 and S5). UpdateDatabase.

     S5: two custom notification types (pattern EFV\EFV\Data\EFV_Notifications.sql; columns per
         Base\Assets\Gameplay\Data\Schema\01_GameplaySchema.sql:2109-2123). Message and Summary stay NULL:
         gameplay supplies LOC_ABN_DEV_NOTIF_*_MESSAGE / _SUMMARY at send time. Icons are shipped rows
         (Base\Assets\UI\Icons\Icons_Notifications.xml:9 GENERIC, :79 CITY_LOST).
         A expires at the end of the turn, B persists.

     S3: loyalty debuff variants, all MODIFIER_SINGLE_CITY_ADJUST_IDENTITY_PER_TURN (DB DynamicModifiers:
         COLLECTION_OWNER, EFFECT_ADJUST_CITY_IDENTITY_PER_TURN; Amount is ARGTYPE_IDENTITY, the column
         default). Vanilla precedent: DLC\BlackDeathScenario\Data\BlackDeathScenario_GameplayData.xml:539,580-587.
     B0  ABN_SPK_LOY_B0  -6, no requirements; attached by Lua (AttachModifierByID).
     B1  ABN_SPK_LOY_B1  -6, SubjectRequirementSetId with REQUIREMENT_PLOT_PROPERTY_MATCHES
                         (PropertyName ABN_SPK_B1, PropertyMinimum 1; argument rows as
                         DLC\CivRoyaleScenario\Data\CivRoyaleScenario_Civilizations.xml:392-406); attached by Lua.
     B2  ABN_SPK_LOY_BIT_1/2/4/8/16  -1/-2/-4/-8/-16, each gated by its own plot property
                         ABN_SPK_DBIT_<n> >= 1, attached to every city by a GameModifiers row of type
                         MODIFIER_ALL_CITIES_ATTACH_MODIFIER (COLLECTION_ALL_CITIES, EFFECT_ATTACH_MODIFIER;
                         pantheon rows such as DIVINE_SPARK_HOLY_SITE use it). GameModifiers plus
                         ALL_CITIES_ATTACH together has no precedent: PENDING S3. -->
